Split the httptest listener address into host and port in the vantara unit
tests. The tests passed the joined host:port string as the host argument with
an empty port, producing https://host:port:/ URLs that the Go 1.26 module
baseline rejects during url parsing; the x/crypto bump raises the go directive
to 1.26. Upstream still carries the joined form on main as of 2026-09-04:
https://github.com/kubev2v/forklift/blob/main/cmd/vsphere-copy-offload-populator/internal/vantara/vantara-api_test.go

